# INDRBT · Six-axis robot arm and parallel gripper

An original digital robotics project connecting mechanical design, robot mathematics, motion, feedback control and a routed KiCad interface board.

**[OPEN THE INTERACTIVE ENGINEERING SHOWCASE](https://pratham-cloud-ctrl.github.io/INDRBT/)** — inspect the 3D robot, 3D PCB, components, schematics and theory in your browser. No CAD application or GitHub sign-in is needed.

**[DOWNLOAD THE PUBLIC ENGINEERING PACKS](https://github.com/pratham-cloud-ctrl/INDRBT/releases/tag/indrbt-2026-10-28)** — STEP/STL CAD, native FreeCAD, the KiCad project, PCB STEP and a combined offline viewer/CAD pack. The repository and release are public; no private access is required. [Choose a format and open it](06_Complete_Project_Source/docs/cad_downloads.md). The published GitHub Pages showcase includes the browser viewers and download controls.

**[CAD & mechanical design](01_CAD_Models/README.md) · [Electronics & KiCad](04_Electronics/README.md) · [Theory & calculations](03_Reports_and_Results/README.md)**

![INDRBT actual CAD assembly with its interchangeable parallel-jaw gripper](01_CAD_Models/Preview_Images/hero.png)

**6 revolute joints · 54 CAD components · 790 mm nominal reach · 90 mm jaw opening**

